    "created_at": "2021-09-14T05:38:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-09-14T05:38:44Z",
    "body": "I don't immediately see how to implement this, since in its naive form, we would have to either make git_branch depend on git_state, or do redundant computations in git_branch (which would slow the module down massively, since reading the state of the repository tends to be the expensive bit).\r\n\r\nHowever, if anyone has a suggestion for how we can do this without adding dependencies between modules, I'd love to find a way to turn this into reality!",
